the text of the_model is at "sources/retip.dmn".

the apply url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://tax-services.phila.gov/_/".

the help url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://www.phila.gov/services/payments-assistance-taxes/payment-plans-and-assistance-programs/income-based-programs-for-residents/set-up-real-estate-tax-installment-plan/".

the help phone of the eligible of the next steps is "(215) 686-6442".

the body of the eligible of the next steps is "Apply through the Philadelphia Tax Center using the combined real estate assistance application, or mail the paper application from the program page.

- Applications must be received by March 31 each year.
- Provide proof of age if applying as a senior, or the income information required for a low-income application.
- Make every required monthly payment. Missing payments can end the plan and make the remaining taxes, interest, and charges due.".

the note of the ineligible of the next steps is "If you are already enrolled and finish all required payments, the City automatically enrolls you for the following year. The application is for new applicants.".

rule checks_1 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already enrolled of the checks is true if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the primary person id of the situation is a text
    and it is not the case that
        the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
        and the primary person id of the situation is the text
        and the person id is equal to the text
        and the benefit is equal to "PhlRetip".

rule checks_2 with provenance the model at decision checks:
the not already enrolled of the checks is false if
    the enrollments of the situation are listed
    and the enrollments of the situation include a person id with a benefit
    and the person id is equal to the primary person id of the situation
    and the benefit is equal to "PhlRetip".

