rule retip_income_service_1 with provenance the model at decision RetipIncomeService:
the retip income service result is true if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the household income of the situation is a number N
        or the household income of the situation is N
            and N < 0
            or it is not the case that the household size of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the household size of the situation is M
        and M < 1
        or the household size of the situation is M
            and the count of the list [42950, 49100, 55250, 61350, 66300, 71200, 76100, 81000] is a number K
            and M > K
            or the household size of the situation is M
                and the household size of the situation is M
                and it is not the case that M = floor(M)
    and the household income of the situation is N
    and the household size of the situation is M
    and the item at position M of the list [42950, 49100, 55250, 61350, 66300, 71200, 76100, 81000] is a value V
    and N < V.

rule retip_income_service_2 with provenance the model at decision RetipIncomeService:
the retip income service result is false if
    it is not the case that
        it is not the case that the household income of the situation is a number N
        or the household income of the situation is N
            and N < 0
            or it is not the case that the household size of the situation is a number M
    and it is not the case that
        the household size of the situation is M
        and M < 1
        or the household size of the situation is M
            and the count of the list [42950, 49100, 55250, 61350, 66300, 71200, 76100, 81000] is a number K
            and M > K
            or the household size of the situation is M
                and the household size of the situation is M
                and it is not the case that M = floor(M)
    and the household income of the situation is N
    and the household size of the situation is M
    and the item at position M of the list [42950, 49100, 55250, 61350, 66300, 71200, 76100, 81000] is a value V
    and N >= V.

